{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础理论","docCount":3,"url":"/h/data-science/data-quality-testing/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"quality-dimensions-metrics","title":"数据质量维度与度量体系","url":"/h/data-science/data-quality-testing/foundations/quality-dimensions-metrics","wordCount":1767,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"data-profiling-discovery","title":"数据剖析与发现技术","url":"/h/data-science/data-quality-testing/foundations/data-profiling-discovery","wordCount":1461,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"quality-architecture-patterns","title":"质量架构与设计模式","url":"/h/data-science/data-quality-testing/foundations/quality-architecture-patterns","wordCount":1469,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"# 基础理论\n\n本章建立数据质量测试的认知基础。从六大质量维度的量化方法开始，到数据剖析（Profiling）技术的实操，再到质量架构的设计模式——形成从\"什么是好数据\"到\"如何系统性地保障好数据\"的完整认知链条。\n\n三篇文档各有侧重：质量维度回答\"测什么\"，数据剖析回答\"怎么发现问题\"，架构模式回答\"怎么组织测试系统\"。建议按顺序阅读，因为后续章节的工具使用和管道集成都建立在这些概念之上。\n"}